    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "11 Ardrew Heights, Dun Brinn, Athy, Co. Kildare A beautifully presented 3 bedroom semi detached residence, ready for immediate occupation and offering modern, comfortable living in one of Athy`s most convenient and family friendly locations.\n\nProperty Overview\nThis attractive home features gas fired central heating, double glazed windows, an en-suite master bedroom, and a bright, well designed layout throughout. With both front and rear gardens, plus side access leading to the rear, the property offers excellent outdoor space. Private off street parking for one car is located to the front.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall\nKitchen / Dining Room with fully fitted wall and floor units\nUtility Room with additional storage, gas boiler, and door to rear garden\nLiving Room with open fireplace and patio doors to the rear garden\nGuest W.C. on the ground floor\nUpstairs:\nThree bedrooms, two with built in wardrobes\nMaster bedroom en-suite\nMain bathroom\n\nBER Rating: C\n\nLocation & Local Area\nArdrew Heights at Dun Brinn, is a mature, well established residential area within easy reach of Athy town centre. Residents enjoy close proximity to schools, shops, cafés, sports facilities, and scenic walking routes.\nThe home benefits from excellent connectivity thanks to the new Athy Distributor Road, providing smoother access to the M9 motorway and significantly reducing travel times to Dublin, Carlow, and surrounding areas. Public transport links, including Athy Train Station, are also easily accessible.\nReady to Move Into\nWith its modern features, generous accommodation, and superb location, this property is ideal for first time buyers, families, or anyone seeking a comfortable home in Athy.\nViewings by appointment with Connaughton Auctioneers.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 2.66m (8'9\") x 2.04m (6'8\")\nCarpeted Staircase, Tiled Floor, Radiator.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 3.73m (12'3\") x 3.08m (10'1\")\nFully Fitted Wall & Floor Units, Stainless Steel Sink, Plumbing for Dish Washer, Cooker Point, Bay Window with Blinds, Tiled Floor, Radiator.\n\nLiving Room - 3.89m (12'9\") x 5.03m (16'6\")\nOpen Fireplace with Feature Surround, Patio Doors to Rear Garden, Timber Flooring, Radiator.\n\nLaundry Room - 1.54m (5'1\") x 3.08m (10'1\")\n\nGuest W.C. - 1.94m (6'4\") x 0.76m (2'6\")\nDownstairs:\nW.C. Wash Hand Basin\n\nLanding - 2.66m (8'9\") x 2.04m (6'8\")\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.94m (9'8\") x 4.47m (14'8\")\nMaster:\nBuilt-In Wardrobes. Timber Flooring, Bay Window, Radiator.\n\nEn-suite - 0.81m (2'8\") x 2.88m (9'5\")\nShower Cubicle with Electric Shower, W.C. Wash Hand Basin\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.75m (12'4\") x 2.51m (8'3\")\nTimber Flooring, Radiator.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.7m (8'10\") x 2.41m (7'11\")\nBuilt-In-Wardrobes, Timber Flooring, Radiator.\n\nBathroom - 1.65m (5'5\") x 2.87m (9'5\")\nBath, W.C. Wash Hand Basin, Airing Press, Part-Tiled Walls\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
